# serial_tx_free=255
READY capture=OFF; send HELP
# Commands: START STOP STATS RESET HELP
#  START  begin capture (count + print frames)
#  STOP   stop capture (CAN1 stays LISTEN_ONLY; frames drained, not counted)
#  STATS  print statistics; fps is over the window since the previous S line
#  RESET  zero all counters
# Frame: F <ms> <id hex> <S|E> <dlc> [payload hex] [R]
# Stats: S key=value ...; status lines start with #
S ms=585 rx=0 std=0 ext=0 rtr=0 fps=0.0 window_ms=54 printed=0 serial_drop=0 hw_overrun=0 dropped_min=0 merr=0 errif=0 eflg_or=0x0 tec_peak=0 rec_peak=0 dlc_gt8=0 int_edges=0 int_missed=0 mode_faults=0 capture=OFF
